WEBVTT

00:01:59.976 --> 00:02:01.470
so that we may gain.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:05.134
We have it backwards. Right?

00:02:05.134 --> 00:02:07.013
So I asked myself, where do
people like this come from?

00:02:07.013 --> 00:02:10.236
And my initial conclusion was
that they're just better people.

00:02:10.236 --> 00:02:11.756
That's why they're attracted to the military.

00:02:11.756 --> 00:02:13.217
These better people are attracted

00:02:13.217 --> 00:02:15.963
to this concept of service.

00:02:15.963 --> 00:02:17.063
But that's completely wrong.

00:02:17.063 --> 00:02:19.900
What I learned was that it's the environment,

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.070
and if you get the environment right,

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.793
every single one of us has the capacity

00:02:23.793 --> 00:02:25.311
to do these remarkable things,

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:28.142
and more importantly, others have that capacity too.

00:02:28.142 --> 00:02:30.587
I've had the great honor of getting to meet